Package: frp
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: fast reverse proxy (frpc client and frps server)
 frp exposes a local server that sits behind NAT or a firewall to the
 internet through a machine with a public address. This package ships
 both ends: the frps server and the frpc client, each driven by a single
 TOML file; example configurations are installed as documentation. Built
 from source without the optional browser dashboards, whose prebuilt
 assets are not part of the source tag.
